<label class="check-line"><input id="kosyncAuto" type="checkbox"> Tá»± Ä‘á»™ng Ä‘á»“ng bá»™ tiáº¿n Ä‘á»™ khi má»Ÿ/Ä‘Ã³ng sÃ¡ch</label>
<label class="muted">Danh má»¥c OPDS (máº·c Ä‘á»‹nh: https://sach.vreader.cloud:8443/opds)</label>
